    "Telephony": "Telefonija",
    "Credentials go on the APIs page: a \"Telnyx\" entry with its API key, or a \"Twilio\" entry with the account SID as client key and the auth token as API key. Leave blank to turn telephony off.": "Il-kredenzjali jmorru fil-paġna tal-APIs: entrata \"Telnyx\" biċ-ċavetta tal-API tagħha, jew entrata \"Twilio\" bl-SID tal-kont bħala ċavetta tal-klijent u t-token tal-awtentikazzjoni bħala ċavetta tal-API. Ħallih vojt biex titfi t-telefonija.",
    "From number": "Numru tal-mittent",
    "Your number at the provider, in E.164 form: the setup button verifies it as caller ID, and inbound calls to it are answered by the agent below.": "In-numru tiegħek għand il-fornitur, f'format E.164: il-buttuna tas-setup tivverifikah bħala ID ta' min iċempel, u t-telefonati deħlin fih iwieġeb għalihom l-aġent hawn taħt.",
    "Answer with agent": "Wieġeb bl-aġent",
    "The live agent that answers incoming calls.": "L-aġent dirett li jwieġeb it-telefonati deħlin.",
    "Auto-accept after": "Aċċetta awtomatikament wara",
    "Answer incoming calls automatically after this many seconds, unless answered or rejected first.": "Wieġeb it-telefonati deħlin awtomatikament wara dan in-numru ta' sekondi, sakemm ma jkunux ġew imwieġba jew miċħuda qabel.",
    "OpenAI project ID": "ID tal-proġett ta' OpenAI",
    "Calls are bridged to sip:<project id>@sip.api.openai.com.": "It-telefonati jiġu konnessi ma' sip:<project id>@sip.api.openai.com.",
    "Allowed countries": "Pajjiżi permessi",
    "Countries calls may be placed to, as comma-separated ISO codes such as GB, US. Applied to the selected provider when changed, and by its setup button.": "Pajjiżi li jistgħu jiġu ċċemplati, bħala kodiċijiet ISO separati b'virgoli bħal GB, US. Jiġi applikat għall-fornitur magħżul meta jinbidel, u bil-buttuna tas-setup tiegħu.",
    "Telnyx connection ID": "ID tal-konnessjoni ta' Telnyx",
    "The Telnyx voice application calls are placed through. \"Set up Telnyx\" creates it for you; its webhook URL is kept up to date automatically.": "L-applikazzjoni tal-leħen ta' Telnyx li minnha jsiru t-telefonati. \"Issettja Telnyx\" toħloqha għalik; il-URL tal-webhook tagħha jinżamm aġġornat awtomatikament.",
    "Set up Telnyx": "Issettja Telnyx",
    "Creates the voice application and outbound profile through the Telnyx API, then verifies the From number as caller ID by SMS code.": "Toħloq l-applikazzjoni tal-leħen u l-profil ħiereġ permezz tal-API ta' Telnyx, imbagħad tivverifika n-numru tal-mittent bħala ID ta' min iċempel b'kodiċi SMS.",
    "Set up Twilio": "Issettja Twilio",
    "Enables the allowed countries and points the From number at the webhook through the Twilio API, then verifies the From number as caller ID with a call from Twilio if the account does not own it.": "Tattiva l-pajjiżi permessi u tipponta n-numru tal-mittent lejn il-webhook permezz tal-API ta' Twilio, imbagħad tivverifika n-numru tal-mittent bħala ID ta' min iċempel b'telefonata minn Twilio jekk il-kont ma jkunx sid tiegħu.",
    "Public URL": "URL pubbliku",
    "Filled in automatically: a Cloudflare quick tunnel is opened to the listener whenever a provider is set, and OpenAI and the provider are pointed at it.": "Jimtela awtomatikament: meta jiġi ssettjat fornitur jinfetaħ quick tunnel ta' Cloudflare lejn il-listener, u OpenAI u l-fornitur jiġu ppuntati lejh.",
    "This will take a while.": "Dan se jieħu ftit żmien.",
